    23	* **Concrete fix:** Rephrase to remove the payment schedule ambiguity:
    24	  > "...at a €4,500 total design hurdle. The integrator pays 50% of the desk-review fee in advance, and the balance of the total hurdle before the site date."
    25	
    26	***
