    28	### Conclusion
    29	
    30	**Verdict: REVISE**
    31	
    32	The essay passes the pre-ship test on economics, scalability, Dutch-language constraints, and competitor fairness. It fails only on the strict receipting rule (Rule 8) due to one misplaced marker.
